Package: metronautica
Type: Package
Title: Wearable Triaxial Accelerometer Metrology and Signal Processing
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-22
Language: en-GB
NeedsCompilation: no
Authors@R: person("Millen James", "Theophilus",
    email = "m.j.theophilus@lboro.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9823-7177"))
Author: Millen James Theophilus [aut, cre]
    (<https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9823-7177>)
Maintainer: Millen James Theophilus <m.j.theophilus@lboro.ac.uk>
Description: Native wearable triaxial accelerometer parsing, signal diagnostics,
    clipping, static and dynamic characterisation, filtering and reporting.
    Metrological terminology follows the International Vocabulary of Metrology,
    JCGM (2012) <doi:10.59161/JCGM200-2012>. Standalone activity counts implement
    the published ActiGraph algorithm of Neishabouri et al. (2022)
    <doi:10.1038/s41598-022-16003-x>, with its published filter as the default
    and configurable band-pass cutoffs for modified counts.
    Developed for the wearable-accelerometer metrology research article under
    submission for publication, with accompanying analyses and data in WAM
    <https://github.com/miltheo/wam>.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/miltheo/metronautica
